          },
          {
            "id": "a3f27edb-15b9-5b79-a047-1149c304b855",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Bufo! My\nfavorite...\nemployee.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "4438129e-1fc7-5b72-8169-3a10592744a4",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Sit.\nActually, don't.\nWe're agile.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "fc64546f-2869-56fd-83b3-226977d6846d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Pondcorp\nhas a problem.\nA big one.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "0b3dadae-d6dd-5f47-a926-b47d8d40e130",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Printers\njam. Emails\nvanish.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "df4aa173-19c9-5bc3-8dfb-f9db3f5f5894",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: The coffee.\nI can't talk about\nthe coffee.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ee4962d5-6a94-52b5-9e20-48b67b10069b",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BUFO: ...",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "80ee817a-7696-5a14-a054-266b6e98f814",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: It's KEVIN.\nOur AI. He's gone\nrogue.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "d02f2180-f390-5071-8775-ee3d59004322",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: I sent a\nmeeting invite to\ndeal with it.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "91ab0175-1267-5174-9454-9eb941f4ccfc",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Everyone\ndeclined. Except\nyou.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "5543736b-eb3a-5f1c-af17-e0ca92f7bba6",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BUFO: ...!",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "2bb9d543-15b8-5833-a847-96b3d3201964",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: That's\nleadership, Bufo.\nThat's ownership.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "31e2dd23-4a18-5080-b5cb-6fc41409e0e3",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Find KEVIN.\nUnplug him.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ac48bc37-b0e8-5310-bd2c-b9be863138ad",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BUFO: ...?",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "b341131b-8fe7-56e3-b36c-4c540a009b2c",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Pay? You'll\nbe paid in\nexperience.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "bf3be535-f533-56ce-9d48-dd97d889917b",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: And\nexposure. To other\ndepartments.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "ac4a1df0-5549-545b-b0df-8d64166064ab",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: Start in\nthe basement. IT\nwill help you.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "58cc7fd2-97ed-5e67-b28c-393a08115a7c",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "BROCK: IT has\nnever\nhelped anyone. But",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "b9c88334-8175-51df-80f1-5951d3b0cfad",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": "still.",
              "avatarId": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "23553fb7-3628-54bd-a218-db20c0909cdd",
